+     ```

-     A diff computed by `diff`, or resolved from a redraft, carries every element in its edits,
-     and says so in its type: it is a `Diff[element] & Retained`, on which `kept` reads an edit's
-     value without handling absence. A diff read from the unix format has no values for its
-     unchanged lines, so it is a plain `Diff`, and cannot be rendered as a redraft.
+     Un diff calculado por `diff`, o resuelto a partir de un redraft, lleva todos los elementos
+     en sus ediciones, y lo dice en su tipo: es un `Diff[element] & Retained`, sobre el que
+     `kept` lee el valor de una edición sin tener que tratar la ausencia. Un diff leído del
+     formato de unix no tiene valores para sus líneas sin cambios, así que es un `Diff` simple,
+     y no puede representarse como redraft.

-     The library is the single source set `dissonance.core`, which compiles for the JVM, Scala.js
-     and Scala Native. Everything is exported to the `soundness` umbrella.
+     La biblioteca es el único conjunto de fuentes `dissonance.core`, que compila para la JVM,
+     Scala.js y Scala Native. Todo se exporta al paraguas `soundness`.

