+     marca.

- entry .retained   marks an edit or a diff as `Retained`, where every value is known to be present
-     An extension on `Diff.Edit` and on `Diff`, returning the receiver typed `& Retained`. It checks
-     nothing: it is the place where code which has just supplied every value records the fact,
-     as `diff` and `Redraft#resolve` do. Marking a diff whose edits lack values makes `kept`
-     return absent values as if they were elements, and a rendered redraft wrong.
+ entry .retained   marca una edición o un diff como `Retained`, donde se sabe que todos los valores están presentes
+     Una extensión sobre `Diff.Edit` y sobre `Diff`, que devuelve el receptor con el tipo
+     `& Retained`. No comprueba nada: es el lugar donde el código que acaba de proporcionar
+     todos los valores deja constancia de ello, como hacen `diff` y `Redraft#resolve`. Marcar un
+     diff cuyas ediciones carecen de valores hace que `kept` devuelva valores ausentes como si
+     fueran elementos, y que un redraft representado sea incorrecto.

